 Tailscale","fr":"home-network-admin est un outil d''administration de réseau qui gère les appareils connectés via Tailscale","de":"home-network-admin ist ein Netzwerkverwaltungstool, das Geräte verwaltet, die über Tailscale verbunden sind","pt":"O que é home-network-admin? É uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de rede doméstica que utiliza yadm para configurar dispositivos e acessar via SSH.","ru":"Что такое home-network-admin? Это инструмент для управления домашней сетью, использующий yadm для настройки устройств и доступа по SSH.","ar":"ما هي home-network-admin؟ هي أداة لإدارة الشبكات المحلية التي تستخدم yadm لتكوين الأجهزة والوصول عبر SSH."},"features":{"en":["Manages devices connected over Tailscale","Provides SSH access to Synology NAS and Macs","Uses yadm for dotfiles management","Defines SSH configs in ~/.ssh/config","Supports short aliases for SSH connections, such as ''ssh synology'' and ''ssh dobro''"],"zh":["使用yadm管理dotfiles","支持Tailscale网络","支持Synology NAS设备","支持Mac设备SSH访问","定义SSH配置","支持自定义端口和用户"],"ja":["yadmでdotfilesを管理","Tailscaleネットワークをサポート","Synology NASデバイスをサポート","MacデバイスのSSHアクセスをサポート","SSH設定を定義","カスタムポートとユーザーをサポート"],"ko":["yadm으로 dotfiles 관리","Tailscale 네트워크 지원","Synology NAS 장치 지원","Mac 장치의 SSH 액세스 지원","SSH 구성 정의","사용자 지정 포트 및 사용자 지원"],"es":["Acceso SSH a dispositivos de red","Configuración de dispositivos con Tailscale","Gestión de dispositivos en una red doméstica","Uso de yadm para la administración de dotfiles","Acceso a Synology NAS mediante SSH","Configuración de redes con Macs y dispositivos de red"],"fr":["Accès SSH aux appareils de réseau","Configuration d''appareils avec Tailscale","Gestion d''appareils dans un réseau domestique","Utilisation de yadm pour l''administration de dotfiles","Accès au NAS Synology via SSH","Configuration de réseaux avec des Macs et des appareils de réseau"],"de":["SSH-Zugriff auf Netzwerkgeräte","Konfiguration von Geräten mit Tailscale","Verwaltung von Geräten in einem Heimnetzwerk","Verwendung von yadm für die Verwaltung von Dotfiles","Zugriff auf Synology NAS über SSH","Konfiguration von Netzwerken mit Macs und Netzwerkgeräten"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de dispositivos conectados via Tailscale","Acesso SSH a dispositivos da rede","Configuração de dispositivos com yadm","Suporte a Synology NAS e Macs","Definição de configurações SSH personalizadas"],"ru":["Управление устройствами, подключенными через Tailscale","Доступ по SSH к устройствам сети","Настройка устройств с помощью yadm","Поддержка Synology NAS и Mac","Определение индивидуальных конфигураций SSH"],"ar":["إدارة الأجهزة المتصلة عبر Tailscale","الوصول عبر SSH إلى أجهزة الشبكة","تكوين الأجهزة باستخدام yadm","دعم Synology NAS و Macs","تحديد إعدادات SSH مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use home-network-admin","home-network-admin setup guide","Tailscale network configuration","yadm dotfiles management","SSH access to Synology NAS","home-network-admin alternative","home-network-admin vs Tailscale","install home-network-admin","home-network-admin tutorial"],"zh":["Home Network Admin","yadm","dotfiles","Tailscale","Synology NAS","Mac SSH","AIエージェント","家庭网络管理","设备管理"],"ja":["Home Network Admin","yadm","dotfiles","Tailscale","Synology NAS","Mac SSH","AIエージェント","家庭ネットワーク管理","デバイス管理"],"ko":["홈 네트워크 관리","yadm","dotfiles","Tailscale","Synology NAS","Mac SSH","AI 에이전트","홈 네트워크 관리","장치 관리"],"es":["home-network-admin","Tailscale","Synology","SSH","yadm","administración de red","configuración de dispositivos","gestión de dispositivos","red doméstica","herramientas de administración de red"],"fr":["home-network-admin","Tailscale","Synology","SSH","yadm","administration de réseau","configuration d''appareils","gestion d''appareils","réseau domestique","outils d''administration de réseau"],"de":["home-network-admin","Tailscale","Synology","SSH","yadm","Netzwerkverwaltung","Gerätekonfiguration","Geräteverwaltung","Heimnetzwerk","Netzwerkverwaltungstools"],"pt":["home-network-admin","yadm","Tailscale","SSH","gerenciamento de rede","Synology NAS","Macs","configuração de dispositivos","acesso SSH"],"ru":["home-network-admin","yadm","Tailscale","SSH","управление сетью","Synology NAS","Mac","настройка устройств","доступ по SSH","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["home-network-admin","yadm","Tailscale","SSH","إدارة الشبكة","Synology NAS","Macs","تكوين الأجهزة","الوصول عبر SSH","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"tdhopper","repo":"dotfiles2.0","repoPath":"tdhopper/dotfiles2.0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.298Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"home-network-admin","description":"Manage and troubleshoot Tims home network, SSH into devices, administer the Synology NAS, and work with Tailscale. Use when the user wants to (1) SSH into or run commands on remote machines (synology, dobro), (2) manage the Synology NAS (files, packages, Docker, backups, Surveillance Station), (3) troubleshoot network connectivity or DNS, (4) check Tailscale status or manage the tailnet, (5) transfer files between machines, (6) check device health or disk usage, (7) manage the Caddy reverse proxy on dobro (*.hopperhosted.com), (8) any home server or home network administration task.","bodyPreview":"# Home Network Admin\n\nAdminister Tim''s home network: devices connected over Tailscale, with a Synology NAS and Macs accessible via SSH.\n\nRead [references/network-inventory.md](references/network-inventory.md) for the full device list, IPs, SSH config, and network topology before performing any task.\n\n## SSH Access\n\nSSH configs are defined in `~/.ssh/config`. Use the short aliases:\n\n- `ssh synology` - Synology NAS (custom port, user tdhopper)\n- `ssh dobro` - Mac (default port, user thopper)\n\nSSH","body":"# Home Network Admin\n\nAdminister Tim''s home network: devices connected over Tailscale, with a Synology NAS and Macs accessible via SSH.\n\nRead [references/network-inventory.md](references/network-inventory.md) for the full device list, IPs, SSH config, and network topology before performing any task.\n\n## SSH Access\n\nSSH configs are defined in `~/.ssh/config`. Use the short aliases:\n\n- `ssh synology` - Synology NAS (custom port, user tdhopper)\n- `ssh dobro` - Mac (default port, user thopper)\n\nSSH keys are managed via 1Password agent. If SSH fails with auth errors, verify 1Password is unlocked and the SSH agent is running.\n\n## Synology NAS Administration\n\nThe Synology runs DSM. Common admin tasks via SSH:\n\n- **Packages**: `synopkg list` (installed), `synopkg status <pkg>`, `synopkg start/stop <pkg>`\n- **Docker/Container Manager**: `sudo docker ps`, `sudo docker logs <container>`, `sudo docker compose` (compose files often in `/volume1/docker/`)\n- **Disk/volume health**: `df -h`, `cat /proc/mdstat`, `synodisk --enum`\n- **Shared folders**: typically under `/volume1/`\n- **DSM web UI**: `https://synology:5001` or `https://100.86.145.18:5001`\n- **Logs**: `/var/log/` and DSM log center\n\nFor destructive operations (deleting files, stopping services, modifying configs), confirm with the user first.\n\n## Tailscale\n\nTailscale connects all devices over a WireGuard mesh. Run `tailscale status` to discover the tailnet name and device list.\n\n- On macOS, the `tailscale` CLI may not be on PATH. Use: `/Applications/Tailscale.app/Contents/MacOS/Tailscale`\n- Check status: `tailscale status` (or the full path above)\n- Verify connectivity: `tailscale ping <hostname>`\n- All devices are reachable via MagicDNS (e.g., `synology.<tailnet>.ts.net`)\n\n## Caddy Reverse Proxy (on dobro)\n\nCaddy runs on dobro, providing HTTPS reverse proxy for `*.hopperhosted.com`. The Caddyfile is at `~/Caddyfile` (tracked in yadm). TLS uses Cloudflare DNS-01 challenge.\n\nSee [references/network-inventory.md](references/network-inventory.md) for the full list of proxied subdomains and backends.\n\n- **Manage Caddy on dobro**: `ssh dobro` then `brew services restart caddy`, `caddy reload --config ~/Caddyfile`\n- **Logs**: `journalctl -u caddy` or `brew services info caddy` depending on how it''s managed\n- **Edit Caddyfile locally**: it''s tracked in yadm dotfiles at `~/Caddyfile`\n\n## File Transfer\n\n- Between local and remote hosts: `scp` or `rsync` using the SSH aliases\n- Example: `rsync -avz ~/files/ synology:/volume1/backup/files/`\n- For large transfers, prefer `rsync` with `--progress`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n1. **Can''t SSH**: Check 1Password is unlocked, verify Tailscale is connected (`tailscale status`), ping the Tailscale IP\n2. **DNS issues**: Check if MagicDNS resolves (`dig @100.100.100.100 synology.<tailnet>.ts.net`), fall back to Tailscale IPs directly\n3. **NAS unresponsive**: Try ping, check DSM web UI, SSH may still work even if DSM is sluggish\n4. **Slow network**: Check if traffic is going through Tailscale relay (`tailscale status` shows DERP relay vs direct connection)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:23.682Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Network Administration Agents requiring secure SSH access and Tailscale device management.","zh":"适用于需要安全SSH访问和Tailscale设备管理的网络管理代理。","ja":"セキュアなSSHアクセスとTailscaleデバイス管理を必要とするネットワーク管理エージェントに適しています。","ko":"안전한 SSH 액세스 및 Tailscale 디바이스 관리가 필요한 네트워크 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de redes que requieren acceso SSH seguro y administración de dispositivos Tailscale.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''administration réseau nécessitant un accès SSH sécurisé et une gestion d''appareils Tailscale.","de":"Ideal für Netzwerkleitungsagenten, die sicheren SSH-Zugriff und Tailscale-Geräteverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Administração de Rede que exigem acesso SSH seguro e gerenciamento de dispositivos Tailscale.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов сетевой администрации, требующих безопасного доступа SSH и управления устройствами Tailscale.","ar":"مثالية لموظفي إدارة الشبكة الذين يتطلبون الوصول آمن إلى SSH وإدارة جهاز Tailscale."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to administer home networks via SSH, leveraging Tailscale for secure device connectivity and a Synology NAS for centralized storage, utilizing SSH configs for seamless access to Macs and the NAS.","zh":"赋予代理通过SSH管理家庭网络的能力，利用Tailscale实现安全的设备连接，并使用Synology NAS进行集中存储，利用SSH配置实现Mac和NAS的无缝访问。","ja":"エージェントがSSHを介してホームネットワークを管理できるようにし、Tailscaleを使用してセキュアなデバイス接続を実現し、Synology NASを使用して集中ストレージを行い、SSH設定を使用してMacとNASへのシームレスなアクセスを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 SSH를 통해 홈 네트워크를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, Tailscale을 사용하여 안전한 디바이스 연결을 실현하고, Synology NAS를 사용하여集中 스토리지를进行하며, SSH 설정을 사용하여 Mac 및 NAS에 대한 无缝 접근을 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar redes domésticas a través de SSH, aprovechando Tailscale para la conectividad de dispositivos segura y un Synology NAS para almacenamiento centralizado, utilizando configuraciones de SSH para un acceso sin problemas a Macs y el NAS.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''administrer les réseaux domestiques via SSH, en exploitant Tailscale pour la connectivité sécurisée des appareils et un Synology NAS pour un stockage centralisé, en utilisant des configurations SSH pour un accès sans interruption aux Macs et au NAS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Heimnetzwerke über SSH zu verwalten, indem Tailscale für sichere Geräteverbindung und ein Synology NAS für zentralisierten Speicher genutzt wird, wobei SSH-Konfigurationen für nahtlosen Zugriff auf Macs und das NAS verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a administrar redes domésticas via SSH, aproveitando Tailscale para conectividade de dispositivos segura e um Synology NAS para armazenamento centralizado, utilizando configurações SSH para acesso sem problemas a Macs e ao NAS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять домашними сетями через SSH, используя Tailscale для безопасной подключения устройств и Synology NAS для централизованного хранилища, используя конфигурации SSH для бесшовного доступа к Mac и NAS.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة الشبكات المنزلية عبر SSH، واستخدام Tailscale للوصول آمن إلى الأجهزة وتخزين مركزي Synology NAS، واستخدام تكوينات SSH للوصول بدون مشاكل إلى أجهزة Mac والNAS."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating network inventory updates using Tailscale and SSH","Debugging connectivity issues on Macs via SSH","Managing Synology NAS configurations and user access"],"zh":["使用Tailscale和SSH自动执行网络清单更新","通过SSH调试Mac上的连接问题","管理Synology NAS配置和用户访问"],"ja":["TailscaleとSSHを使用してネットワークインベントリの更新を自動化する","SSHを介してMacの接続問題をデバッグする","Synology NASの設定とユーザーアクセスを管理する"],"ko":["Tailscale과 SSH를 사용하여 네트워크 인벤토리 업데이트를 자동화하는 것","SSH를 통해 Mac의 연결 문제를 디버깅하는 것","Synology NAS의 구성 및 사용자 액세스를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de inventario de red utilizando Tailscale y SSH","Depuración de problemas de conectividad en Macs a través de SSH","Administración de configuraciones y acceso de usuario de Synology NAS"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour d''inventaire réseau à l''aide de Tailscale et de SSH","Débogage des problèmes de connectivité sur Macs via SSH","Gestion des configurations et de l''accès utilisateur de Synology NAS"],"de":["Automatisierung von Netzwerk-Inventar-Aktualisierungen unter Verwendung von Tailscale und SSH","Fehlerbehebung bei Konnektivitätsproblemen auf Macs über SSH","Verwaltung von Synology NAS-Konfigurationen und Benutzerzugriff"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de inventário de rede usando Tailscale e SSH","Depurar problemas de conectividade em Macs via SSH","Gerenciar configurações e acesso de usuário do Synology NAS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления сетевого инвентаря с помощью Tailscale и SSH","Отладить проблемы соединения на Mac через SSH","Управлять конфигурациями и доступом пользователей Synology NAS"],"ar":["تutomatizar تحديثات الجرد الشبكي باستخدام Tailscale و SSH","تصحيح مشاكل الاتصال على أجهزة Mac عبر SSH","إدارة تكوينات ووصول المستخدمين إلى Synology NAS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tailscale setup and configuration","SSH access and configuration necessary","Compatibility limited to devices accessible via Tailscale and SSH"],"zh":["需要Tailscale设置和配置","需要SSH访问和配置","兼容性仅限于可通过Tailscale和SSH访问的设备"],"ja":["Tailscaleの設定と構成が必要","SSHアクセスと構成が必要","互換性はTailscaleとSSH経由でアクセス可能なデバイスに限定される"],"ko":["Tailscale 설정 및 구성이 필요합니다.","SSH 액세스 및 구성이 필요합니다.","호환성은 Tailscale 및 SSH를 통해 액세스할 수 있는 디바이스로 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración y configuración de Tailscale","Acceso y configuración de SSH necesarios","Compatibilidad limitada a dispositivos accesibles a través de Tailscale y SSH"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et une configuration de Tailscale","Accès et configuration SSH nécessaires","Compatibilité limitée aux appareils accessibles via Tailscale et SSH"],"de":["Benötigt Tailscale-Setup und -Konfiguration","SSH-Zugriff und -Konfiguration erforderlich","Kompatibilität auf Geräte beschränkt, die über Tailscale und SSH zugänglich sind"],"pt":["Requer configuração e instalação do Tailscale","Acesso e configuração SSH necessários","Compatibilidade limitada a dispositivos acessíveis via Tailscale e SSH"],"ru":["Требуется настройка и конфигурация Tailscale","Необходим доступ и конфигурация SSH","Совместимость ограничена устройствами, доступными через Tailscale и SSH"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتهيئة Tailscale","مطلوب الوصول إلى SSH والتهيئة","التوافق محدود بالأجهزة القابلة للوصول عبر Tailscale و SSH"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"940c37ccc250d8b3a492c61a9176f008c87ab0cc36a4a91733859600b11e5789","qualityScore":20}');
