INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('KanayaActa/ai-driven-dev-template/commit-push-pr-flow', 'commit-push-pr-flow', 'KanayaActa', 'ai-driven-dev-template', 'community', 'commit-push-pr-flow KanayaActa ai-driven-dev-template community The commit-push-pr-flow skill automates Git workflows for developers, generating Conventional Commits messages and creating PRs with ease. Commit-Push-PR-Flow是一种优化代码提交和审查的流程，通过git和GitHub API实现高效的代码管理 Commit-Push-PR-Flowは、コードの提出とレビューを最適化するための手順です。gitとGitHub APIを使用して効率的なコード管理を実現します Commit-Push-PR-Flow는 코드 제출과 리뷰를 최적화하는 절차입니다. git과 GitHub API를 사용하여 효율적인 코드 관리를 구현합니다 El commit-push-pr-flow es un flujo de trabajo de Git que automatiza los commits, push y solicitudes de extracción. Aprende a configurarlo para mejorar tu productividad Le commit-push-pr-flow est un workflow Git qui automatise les commits, push et demandes d''extraction. Découvrez comment le configurer pour améliorer votre productivité Der commit-push-pr-flow ist ein Git-Workflow, der Commits, Push und Pull-Requests automatisiert. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ihn konfigurieren, um Ihre Produktivität zu steigern O fluxo de commit, push e PR é uma sequência de comandos Git para gerenciar alterações no código. Aprenda a configurá-lo com o agente AI Ferramentas Поток commit, push и PR - это последовательность команд Git для управления изменениями в коде. Узнайте, как настроить его с помощью ИИ Агенты تدفق Commit و Push و PR هو تسلسل من أوامر Git لإدارة التغييرات في الكود. تعرف على كيفية إعداده مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي commit-push-pr-flow setup guide git workflow automation conventional commits tutorial github cli commands automate git commits pr creation best practices git push workflow commit-push-pr-flow alternative how to use commit-push-pr-flow commit-push-pr-flow install Commit-Push-PR-Flow 代码提交 代码审查 git GitHub API Conventional Commits 代码管理 自动化代码提交 优化代码提交和审查 Generates Conventional Commits messages for commit consistency Automates `git add` and `git commit` commands for streamlined workflow Creates PRs using `gh pr create` command with customizable titles and bodies Supports `git push` with upstream tracking for seamless remote updates Integrates with GitHub CLI for PR creation and viewing Enforces best practices with PR title and body formatting guidelines commit-push-pr-flow is a Git workflow automation skill that generates Conventional Commits messages and creates PRs using Git and GitHub CLI commands.');
