te de inteligencia artificial que utiliza la línea de comandos gh para crear solicitudes de extracción en GitHub","fr":"Create-pr est un outil d''agent d''intelligence artificielle qui utilise la ligne de commande gh pour créer des demandes d''extraction sur GitHub","de":"Create-pr ist ein KI-Tool, das die Kommandozeile gh verwendet, um Pull-Requests auf GitHub zu erstellen","pt":"O Create-PR é uma ferramenta que cria solicitações de pull request no GitHub","ru":"Create-PR - это инструмент для создания запросов на слияние в GitHub","ar":"Create-PR هو أداة لإنشاء طلبات سحب في GitHub"},"features":{"en":["Creates a new branch for changes using Git","Commits changes to the new branch","Pushes the branch to the remote GitHub repository","Uses the gh CLI to create a pull request","Specifies the target branch as master by default","Provides the URL to the created pull request"],"zh":["自动创建新分支","提交更改到新分支","推送分支到远程仓库","使用 gh CLI 创建合并请求","支持 React 框架","提供合并请求 URL"],"ja":["自動的に新しいブランチを作成","変更を新しいブランチにコミット","ブランチをリモートリポジトリにプッシュ","gh CLI を使用してプルリクエストを作成","React フレームワークをサポート","プルリクエスト URL を提供"],"ko":["자동으로 새로운 브랜치를 생성","변경을 새로운 브랜치에 커밋","브랜치를 원격 저장소에 푸시","gh CLI를 사용하여 풀 리퀘스트를 생성","React 프레임워크를 지원","풀 리퀘스트 URL을 제공"],"es":["Creación de ramas para cambios","Confirmación de cambios en la rama","Envío de la rama a un repositorio remoto","Uso de la línea de comandos gh para crear solicitudes de extracción","Soporte para la rama master y otras ramas de destino"],"fr":["Création de branches pour les modifications","Validation des modifications dans la branche","Envoi de la branche à un référentiel distant","Utilisation de la ligne de commande gh pour créer des demandes d''extraction","Prise en charge de la branche master et d''autres branches cibles"],"de":["Erstellung von Branches für Änderungen","Bestätigung von Änderungen im Branch","Übertragung des Branches an ein Remote-Repository","Verwendung der Kommandozeile gh zum Erstellen von Pull-Requests","Unterstützung für die Master-Branch und andere Ziel-Branches"],"pt":["Criação de branches para alterações","Commit de alterações para o branch","Push do branch para o repositório remoto","Uso do CLI gh para criar solicitações de pull request","Specifying target branch como master, se não especificado"],"ru":["Создание веток для изменений","Фиксация изменений в ветку","Отправка ветки в удаленный репозиторий","Использование CLI gh для создания запросов на слияние","Указание целевой ветки как master, если не указано иное"],"ar":["إنشاء فروع للتعديلات","التعهد بالتعديلات إلى الفرع","دفع الفرع إلى المستودع البعيد","استخدام CLI gh لإنشاء طلبات سحب","تحديد الفرع المستهدف كـ master، إذا لم يتم تحديده"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use create-pr","create-pr setup guide","create-pr vs GitHub CLI","create-pr install","what is create-pr","create-pr alternative","automating pull requests with create-pr","create-pr for React developers","GitHub pull request automation"],"zh":["Create-PR","GitHub 合并请求","自动化工作流程","React 框架","gh CLI","AI 工具","开发效率","GitHub 仓库管理"],"ja":["Create-PR","GitHub プルリクエスト","ワークフロー自動化","React フレームワーク","gh CLI","AI エージェント","開発効率","GitHub リポジトリ管理"],"ko":["Create-PR","GitHub 풀 리퀘스트","자동화된 워크플로우","React 프레임워크","gh CLI","AI 에이전트","개발 효율성","GitHub 저장소 관리"],"es":["create-pr","agente de inteligencia artificial","GitHub","solicitudes de extracción","línea de comandos gh","desarrollo de software","automatización de tareas","integración continua","entrega continua"],"fr":["create-pr","outils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","GitHub","demandes d''extraction","ligne de commande gh","développement de logiciels","automatisation de tâches","intégration continue","livraison continue"],"de":["create-pr","KI-Tools","GitHub","Pull-Requests","Kommandozeile gh","Softwareentwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","kontinuierliche Integration","kontinuierliche Lieferung"],"pt":["create-pr","solicitação de pull request","github","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","open source","contribuição para projetos","CLI gh","react","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["create-pr","запрос на слияние","github","инструмент для разработчиков","открытый исходный код","внесение изменений в проекты","CLI gh","react","разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["create-pr","طلب سحب","github","أداة تطوير","مفتوح المصدر","مساهمة في المشاريع","CLI gh","react","تطوير البرمجيات","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"uhyo","repo":"funstack-static","repoPath":"uhyo/funstack-static","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.357Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-pr","description":"A skill to create a pull request on a GitHub repository. Use this skill when the user wants to create a pull request for the changes you have made.","bodyPreview":"# Create Pull Request Skill\n\nTo satisfy the user''s request to create a pull request on a GitHub repository, follow these steps:\n\n1. Create a new branch for the changes (if not already done).\n2. Commit the changes to the new branch.\n3. Push the branch to the remote repository.\n4. Use the `gh` CLI to create a pull request. The target branch is `master` unless specified otherwise.\n\nThen inform the user that the pull request has been created successfully, providing the URL to the pull request.\n\n## M","body":"# Create Pull Request Skill\n\nTo satisfy the user''s request to create a pull request on a GitHub repository, follow these steps:\n\n1. Create a new branch for the changes (if not already done).\n2. Commit the changes to the new branch.\n3. Push the branch to the remote repository.\n4. Use the `gh` CLI to create a pull request. The target branch is `master` unless specified otherwise.\n\nThen inform the user that the pull request has been created successfully, providing the URL to the pull request.\n\n## Merging the Pull Request\n\nAfter the user reviews the pull request and requests to merge it, you can use the `gh` CLI to merge the pull request. Confirm with the user before merging.\n\nNote that you should use the squash merge.\n\n## Steps After Merging the Pull Request\n\nAfter merging the pull request, follow these steps so that the local repository is ready for future work:\n\n1. Switch back to the `master` branch.\n2. Pull the latest changes from the remote `master` branch to ensure the local repository is up to date.\n3. Delete the local branch that was used for the pull request. (Note: remote branch is automatically deleted by GitHub)\n4. Inform the user that the pull request is merged and the local repository is now up to date and ready for future work.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:03.007Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated GitHub workflow management.","zh":"适合需要自动化 GitHub 工作流管理的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub ワークフロー管理の自動化が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 워크플로우 관리 자동화가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo automatizada de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de workflow GitHub automatisée.","de":"Perfekt für EntwicklungssAgenten, die eine automatisierte GitHub-Workflow-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho automatizado do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированное управление рабочим процессом GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تدفق العمل الآلي على GitHub."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline GitHub repository management using the `gh` CLI, creating new branches, committing changes, and pushing to remote repositories over HTTPS or SSH protocols.","zh":"赋予代理使用 `gh` CLI 简化 GitHub 仓库管理的能力，包括创建新分支、提交更改和通过 HTTPS 或 SSH 协议推送到远程仓库。","ja":"エージェントが `gh` CLI を使用して GitHub リポジトリ管理を簡素化できるようにし、新しいブランチを作成し、変更をコミットし、HTTPS または SSH プロトコル経由でリモートリポジトリにプッシュします。","ko":"에이전트가 `gh` CLI를 사용하여 GitHub 저장소 관리를 간소화할 수 있도록 하며, 새로운 브랜치를 생성하고, 변경 사항을 커밋하고, HTTPS 또는 SSH 프로토콜을 통해 원격 저장소에 푸시합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes simplificar la gestión de repositorios de GitHub utilizando el `gh` CLI, creando nuevas ramas, confirmando cambios y enviándolos a repositorios remotos a través de protocolos HTTPS o SSH.","fr":"Permet aux agents de simplifier la gestion des référentiels GitHub en utilisant le `gh` CLI, en créant de nouvelles branches, en confirmant des modifications et en les envoyant à des référentiels distants via les protocoles HTTPS ou SSH.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Verwaltung von GitHub-Repositorys mithilfe des `gh` CLI zu rationalisieren, indem neue Zweige erstellt, Änderungen bestätigt und an Remote-Repositorys über HTTPS- oder SSH-Protokolle gesendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem a gestão de repositórios do GitHub usando o `gh` CLI, criando novos branches, cometando alterações e enviando para repositórios remotos sobre protocolos HTTPS ou SSH.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать управление репозиториями GitHub с помощью `gh` CLI, создавая новые ветки, фиксируя изменения и отправляя их в удаленные репозитории по протоколам HTTPS или SSH.","ar":"يسمح للوكيل بتبسيط إدارة مستودع GitHub باستخدام `gh` CLI، إنشاء فروع جديدة وتعديل التعديلات وإرسالها إلى مستودعات بعيدة عبر بروتوكولات HTTPS أو SSH."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull requests for React framework updates","Generating new branches for feature development","Pushing changes to remote repositories for collaborative review"],"zh":["自动化 React 框架更新的拉取请求","为功能开发生成新的分支","将更改推送到远程仓库以进行协作审查"],"ja":["React フレームワークの更新のプルリクエストを自動化する","機能開発の新しいブランチを生成する","変更をリモートリポジトリにプッシュして共同レビューを行う"],"ko":["React 프레임워크 업데이트의 풀 요청 자동화","기능 개발을 위한 새로운 브랜치 생성","변경 사항을 원격 저장소에 푸시하여 협업 검토 수행"],"es":["Automatización de solicitudes de extracción para actualizaciones del marco de trabajo React","Generación de nuevas ramas para el desarrollo de características","Envío de cambios a repositorios remotos para revisión colaborativa"],"fr":["Automatisation des demandes d''extraction pour les mises à jour du framework React","Génération de nouvelles branches pour le développement de fonctionnalités","Envoi de modifications à des référentiels distants pour une révision collaborative"],"de":["Automatisierung von Pull-Anfragen für React-Framework-Updates","Erstellen neuer Zweige für die Funktionsentwicklung","Übertragung von Änderungen an Remote-Repositorys für eine gemeinsame Überprüfung"],"pt":["Automatizar solicitações de pull para atualizações do framework React","Gerar novos branches para desenvolvimento de recursos","Enviar alterações para repositórios remotos para revisão colaborativa"],"ru":["Автоматизация запросов на слияние для обновлений фреймворка React","Генерация новых веток для разработки функций","Отправка изменений в удаленные репозитории для совместного обзора"],"ar":["أتمتة طلبات السحب لتحديثات إطار العمل React","إنشاء فروع جديدة لتطوير الميزات","إرسال التعديلات إلى مستودعات بعيدة للتحكم التعاوني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub repository access","Needs `gh` CLI installed and configured","Limited to GitHub repositories only"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 仓库访问权限","需要安装和配置 `gh` CLI","仅限 GitHub 仓库"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","`gh` CLI をインストールして構成する必要がある","GitHub リポジトリのみに限定される"],"ko":["GitHub 저장소 액세스 권한 필요","`gh` CLI 설치 및 구성 필요","GitHub 저장소만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de GitHub","Necesita que el `gh` CLI esté instalado y configurado","Limitado solo a los repositorios de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel GitHub","Nécessite que le `gh` CLI soit installé et configuré","Limité uniquement aux référentiels GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das GitHub-Repository","Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration des `gh` CLI","Eingeschränkt auf GitHub-Repositorys"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório do GitHub","Necessita `gh` CLI instalado e configurado","Limitado a repositórios do GitHub apenas"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к репозиторию GitHub","Требуется `gh` CLI установленный и настроенный","Ограничен только репозиториями GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع GitHub","يتطلب `gh` CLI مثبتًا ومُكوّنًا","محدود بمستودعات GitHub فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"cacdef73f1482e988873d047a71beb184a29d0163f67eef7af9200207b7c0138","qualityScore":20}');
