INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('LDmoxeii/only-danmuku/cleanddd-requirements-analysis', 'cleanddd-requirements-analysis', 'LDmoxeii', 'only-danmuku', 'community', 'cleanddd-requirements-analysis LDmoxeii only-danmuku community The cleanddd-requirements-analysis skill enables AI agents to perform demand analysis and produce structured descriptions for CleanDDD modeling, benefiting developers and modelers. It analyzes business needs and breaks them down into actionable items. CleanDDD需求分析技能是面向CleanDDD建模前的需求澄清与拆解，产出的结构化需求描述 CleanDDD要件分析AIエージェントは、CleanDDDモデリング前の要件分析と分解を行い、構造化された要件記述を生成します CleanDDD 요구 사항 분석 도구는 CleanDDD 모델링 전의 요구 사항 분석과 분해를 수행하여 구조화된 요구 사항 설명을 생성합니다 cleanddd-requirements-analysis es una habilidad que analiza requisitos y estructura descripciones de requisitos para un modelado eficaz cleanddd-requirements-analysis est une compétence qui analyse les exigences et structure les descriptions de requisitos pour un modelage efficace cleanddd-requirements-analysis ist eine Fähigkeit, die Anforderungen analysiert und Anforderungsbeschreibungen strukturiert für ein effektives Modellieren O cleanddd-requirements-analysis é uma habilidade que realiza análise de requisitos e descrição estruturada para projetos de desenvolvimento de software ИИ Агент cleanddd-requirements-analysis выполняет анализ требований и структурированное описание для проектов разработки ПО cleanddd-requirements-analysis هو مهارة تقوم بتحليل المتطلبات والوصف الهيكلي لمشاريع تطوير البرمجيات how to use cleanddd-requirements-analysis cleanddd-requirements-analysis setup guide cleanddd-requirements-analysis vs traditional modeling cleanddd-requirements-analysis install what is cleanddd-requirements-analysis cleanddd-requirements-analysis alternative cleanddd-requirements-analysis for AI agents cleanddd-requirements-analysis tutorial cleanddd-requirements-analysis best practices CleanDDD 需求分析 结构化描述 AI工具 需求澄清 建模 业务实体 触发场景 Collects and confirms business scenarios, roles, inputs, outputs, and constraints Identifies stakeholders and their corresponding demands Splits demands into executable items based on actions like view, create, modify, close, or asynchronous tasks Classifies business entities and records core responsibilities and constraints Recognizes trigger scenarios based on events, states, or operations and records subsequent actions Supplements key business rules and input/output information cleanddd-requirements-analysis is a skill for analyzing and structuring business demands prior to CleanDDD modeling, producing outputs like scenarios, stakeholders, and classified business entities.');
