ko":"LocalStack 서비스 티어 参考는 KECS 및 ECS 통합의 기술적인 세부 정보를 제공하는 서비스 티어 정보입니다","es":"LocalStack Service Tiers Reference es un servicio que proporciona información sobre la disponibilidad de servicios en diferentes niveles de precios","fr":"LocalStack Service Tiers Reference est un service qui fournit des informations sur la disponibilité des services dans les différents niveaux de tarification","de":"LocalStack Service Tiers Reference ist ein Dienst, der Informationen über die Verfügbarkeit von Diensten in verschiedenen Preisstufen bereitstellt","pt":"O que é LocalStack Service Tiers Reference? É um recurso que fornece informações sobre a disponibilidade de serviços do LocalStack em diferentes níveis de preços","ru":"Что такое LocalStack Service Tiers Reference? Это функция, предоставляющая информацию о доступности сервисов LocalStack на разных уровнях цен","ar":"ما هو مرجع طبقات الخدمة المحلية؟ هو ميزة توفر معلومات حول توافر خدمات المحلية في مستويات الأسعار المختلفة"},"features":{"en":["Provides knowledge about LocalStack service availability across pricing tiers","Explains the limitations of the free tier for ECS integrations","Details the requirements for Base tier ($39/mo) for ECS compatibility","Supports KECS development with Amazon ECS compatible APIs on Kubernetes","Offers a quick reference guide for LocalStack service tiers","Clarifies the differences between LocalStack''s free and paid tiers for ECS"],"zh":["KECS 使用 LocalStack 提供 Amazon ECS 兼容 API","ECS 不在 LocalStack 免费版中，需要 Base 版本 ($39/月)","KECS 提供免费的本地 ECS 兼容环境","支持 Kubernetes 和 ECS 集成","提供服务等级参考信息"],"ja":["KECS は LocalStack を使用して Amazon ECS 互換 API を提供します","ECS は LocalStack の無料版では利用できないため、Base 版 ($39/月) が必要です","KECS は無料のローカル ECS 互換環境を提供します","Kubernetes と ECS 統合をサポート","サービス ティア リファレンス情報を提供"],"ko":["KECS는 LocalStack를 사용하여 Amazon ECS 호환 API를 제공합니다","ECS는 LocalStack의 무료 버전에서 사용할 수 없으므로 Base 버전($39/월)이 필요합니다","KECS는 무료로 로컬 ECS 호환 환경을 제공합니다","Kubernetes 및 ECS 통합을 지원","서비스 티어 참고 정보를 제공"],"es":["KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service)","APIs compatibles con Amazon ECS en Kubernetes","Disponibilidad de servicios en diferentes niveles de precios","Niveles de precios de LocalStack, incluyendo el nivel gratuito y el nivel Base","Compatibilidad con LocalStack para entornos de desarrollo locales","Uso de LocalStack para servicios AWS compatibles"],"fr":["KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service)","APIs compatibles Amazon ECS sur Kubernetes","Disponibilité des services dans les différents niveaux de tarification","Niveaux de tarification de LocalStack, y compris le niveau gratuit et le niveau Base","Compatibilité avec LocalStack pour les environnements de développement locaux","Utilisation de LocalStack pour les services AWS compatibles"],"de":["KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service)","AWS-kompatible APIs auf Kubernetes","Verfügbarkeit von Diensten in verschiedenen Preisstufen","Preisstufen von LocalStack, einschließlich der kostenlosen Stufe und der Basis-Stufe","Kompatibilität mit LocalStack für lokale Entwicklungsumgebungen","Verwendung von LocalStack für AWS-kompatible Dienste"],"pt":["KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service)","Suporte a APIs ECS compatíveis","Disponibilidade de serviços em diferentes níveis de preços","Ambientes ECS compatíveis gratuitamente","Integração com LocalStack"],"ru":["KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service)","Поддержка ECS-совместимых API","Доступность сервисов на разных уровнях цен","Бесплатные среды ECS","Интеграция с LocalStack"],"ar":["KECS (خدمة متوافقة مع ECS على أساس Kubernetes)","دعم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات ECS المتوافقة","توافر خدمات في مستويات الأسعار المختلفة","بيئات ECS متوافقة مجانًا","التكامل مع المحلية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","what is LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","LocalStack Service Tiers Reference alternative","LocalStack Service Tiers Reference vs KECS","LocalStack Service Tiers Reference setup guide","LocalStack Service Tiers Reference install","KECS development with LocalStack","ECS compatibility on Kubernetes","LocalStack pricing tiers","LocalStack free tier limitations"],"zh":["LocalStack 服务等级参考","KECS","ECS","Kubernetes","AI 工具","开发环境优化","云计算","服务等级"],"ja":["LocalStack サービス ティア リファレンス","KECS","ECS","Kubernetes","AI ツール","開発環境最適化","クラウド コンピューティング","サービス ティア"],"ko":["LocalStack 서비스 티어 参考","KECS","ECS","Kubernetes","AI 도구","개발 환경 최적화","클라우드 컴퓨팅","서비스 티어"],"es":["LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","KECS","ECS","Kubernetes","AWS","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","Entornos de desarrollo locales","Servicios en la nube","Niveles de precios de LocalStack","Herramientas de desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","KECS","ECS","Kubernetes","AWS","Développement d''applications","Environnements de développement locaux","Services cloud","Niveaux de tarification de LocalStack","Outils de développement d''applications"],"de":["LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","KECS","ECS","Kubernetes","AWS","Anwendungsentwicklung","Lokale Entwicklungsumgebungen","Cloud-Dienste","Preisstufen von LocalStack","Anwendungsentwicklungstools"],"pt":["LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","KECS","ECS compatível","Ambientes ECS gratuitos","Integração LocalStack","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Serviços de nuvem","Kubernetes"],"ru":["LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","KECS","ECS-совместимый","Бесплатные среды ECS","Интеграция LocalStack","Разработка приложений","Облачные сервисы","Kubernetes","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["مرجع طبقات الخدمة المحلية","KECS","ECS متوافق","بيئات ECS مجانية","التكامل مع المحلية","تطوير التطبيقات","خدمات السحابة","Kubernetes","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"nandemo-ya","repo":"kecs","repoPath":"nandemo-ya/kecs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","description":"Reference for LocalStack AWS service availability by tier (Free/Base/Ultimate). Essential for KECS development to understand which AWS-compatible services can be used locally without cost.","bodyPreview":"# LocalStack Service Tiers Reference\n\nThis skill provides knowledge about LocalStack service availability across pricing tiers.\nKECS uses LocalStack for AWS-compatible services, relying on free tier services for ECS integrations.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Key Insight for KECS Development\n\n**ECS is NOT available in LocalStack Free tier** - it requires Base tier ($39/mo).\nThis is one of the primary reasons KECS exists: to provide a free, local ECS-compatible environment.\n\n### Pricing Tiers\n\n| Tier","body":"# LocalStack Service Tiers Reference\n\nThis skill provides knowledge about LocalStack service availability across pricing tiers.\nKECS uses LocalStack for AWS-compatible services, relying on free tier services for ECS integrations.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Key Insight for KECS Development\n\n**ECS is NOT available in LocalStack Free tier** - it requires Base tier ($39/mo).\nThis is one of the primary reasons KECS exists: to provide a free, local ECS-compatible environment.\n\n### Pricing Tiers\n\n| Tier | Price | Services |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| Free (Community) | $0 | 30+ services |\n| Base | $39/mo | 55+ services |\n| Ultimate | $89/mo | 110+ services |\n\n### Free Tier Services (Commonly Used with ECS)\n\nThese services are available for free and can be used with KECS:\n\n- **S3** - Object storage\n- **DynamoDB** - NoSQL database\n- **SQS** - Simple Queue Service\n- **SNS** - Simple Notification Service\n- **IAM** - Identity and Access Management\n- **SecretsManager** - Secrets management\n- **KMS** - Key Management Service\n- **SSM** - Systems Manager (Parameter Store)\n- **STS** - Security Token Service\n- **ACM** - Certificate Manager\n- **CloudWatch** - Monitoring (basic features)\n- **CloudWatch Logs** - Logging (basic features)\n- **Lambda** - Serverless functions (basic features)\n\n### Paid Tier Only Services (NOT Free)\n\nThese require LocalStack Base or Ultimate:\n\n- **ECS** - Elastic Container Service (Base+)\n- **ECR** - Elastic Container Registry (Base+)\n- **ELB/ALB** - Load Balancing (Base+)\n- **EC2** - Docker VM mode (Base+, Mock mode is free)\n\n## Detailed Documentation\n\nSee `service-tiers.md` for complete service tier information.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:04.668Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Infrastructure Agents needing insights into LocalStack service tiers and ECS compatibility on Kubernetes.","zh":"非常适合需要对 LocalStack 服务等级和 ECS 在 Kubernetes 上兼容性有洞察力的云基础设施代理。","ja":"LocalStack サービスの階層と Kubernetes での ECS との互換性の洞察が必要なクラウドインフラストラクチャエージェントに最適です。","ko":"LocalStack 서비스 티어 및 Kubernetes에서 ECS 호환성을洞察해야 하는 클라우드 인프라 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de infraestructura en la nube que necesitan información sobre los niveles de servicio de LocalStack y la compatibilidad con ECS en Kubernetes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''infrastructure cloud ayant besoin d''informations sur les niveaux de service LocalStack et la compatibilité ECS sur Kubernetes.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Infrastruktur-Agenten, die Einblicke in die LocalStack-Service-Tiers und die ECS-Kompatibilität auf Kubernetes benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Infraestrutura em Nuvem que precisam de informações sobre os níveis de serviço do LocalStack e a compatibilidade com o ECS no Kubernetes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов инфраструктуры облака, которым требуются сведения о уровнях обслуживания LocalStack и совместимости с ECS в Kubernetes.","ar":"مثالي لعميل برمجيات البنية التحتية السحابية الذين يحتاجون إلى رؤى حول مستويات خدمة LocalStack ومتطلبات ECS على Kubernetes."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate LocalStack pricing tiers, understanding service availability and limitations, particularly for ECS integrations requiring the Base tier ($39/mo) or higher, leveraging knowledge of AWS-compatible services and Kubernetes.","zh":"赋予代理导航 LocalStack 定价等级的能力，了解服务的可用性和限制，特别是需要基础等级（39 美元/月）或更高等级的 ECS 集成，利用对 AWS 兼容服务和 Kubernetes 的知识。","ja":"LocalStack の価格階層をエージェントがナビゲートできるようにし、サービス可用性と制限を理解することができ、特にベース階層（$39/月）以上が必要な ECS 統合では、AWS と互換性のあるサービスや Kubernetes に関する知識を活用できます。","ko":"에이전트가 LocalStack 요금제를 탐색할 수 있도록 하여 서비스 가용성과 제한을 이해할 수 있으며, 특히 기본 티어($39/월) 이상이 필요한 ECS 통합에서는 AWS와 호환되는 서비스 및 Kubernetes에 대한 지식을 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a navegar por los niveles de precios de LocalStack, comprendiendo la disponibilidad del servicio y las limitaciones, particularmente para las integraciones de ECS que requieren el nivel Base ($39/mes) o superior, aprovechando el conocimiento de los servicios compatibles con AWS y Kubernetes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer dans les niveaux de tarification de LocalStack, en comprenant la disponibilité des services et les limitations, en particulier pour les intégrations ECS nécessitant le niveau Base ($39/mois) ou supérieur, en exploitant les connaissances des services compatibles AWS et Kubernetes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Preistiers von LocalStack zu navigieren, die Serviceverfügbarkeit und Einschränkungen zu verstehen, insbesondere für ECS-Integrationen, die das Basis-Tier ($39/Monat) oder höher erfordern, unter Nutzung von Kenntnissen über AWS-kompatible Dienste und Kubernetes.","pt":"Permite que os agentes naveguem pelas faixas de preços do LocalStack, entendendo a disponibilidade e as limitações dos serviços, particularmente para integrações do ECS que exigem a faixa de preços Base ($39/mês) ou superior, aproveitando o conhecimento dos serviços compatíveis com a AWS e o Kubernetes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ориентироваться в тарифных планах LocalStack, понимать доступность и ограничения сервисов, особенно для интеграций ECS, требующих тарифного плана Base ($39/мес) или выше, используя знания о сервисах, совместимых с AWS, и Kubernetes.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التنقل في فئات أسعار LocalStack، وفهم توافر الخدمات والقيود، خاصة للتكاملات ECS التي تتطلب فئة الأسعار الأساسية ($39/الشهر) أو أعلى، واستخدام المعرفة بخدمات AWS المتوافقة و Kubernetes."},"useCases":{"en":["Determining service availability across LocalStack pricing tiers","Identifying ECS compatibility on Kubernetes","Optimizing KECS development with LocalStack free tier limitations"],"zh":["确定 LocalStack 定价等级中的服务可用性","确定 Kubernetes 上的 ECS 兼容性","优化 KECS 开发同时考虑 LocalStack 免费等级的限制"],"ja":["LocalStack の価格階層におけるサービス可用性を決定する","Kubernetes 上の ECS との互換性を特定する","LocalStack 無料階層の制限を考慮して KECS 開発を最適化する"],"ko":["LocalStack 요금제에서 서비스 가용성을 결정하는 것","Kubernetes에서 ECS 호환성을 식별하는 것","LocalStack 무료 티어의 제한을 고려하여 KECS 개발을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Determinar la disponibilidad del servicio en los diferentes niveles de precios de LocalStack","Identificar la compatibilidad de ECS en Kubernetes","Optimizar el desarrollo de KECS con las limitaciones del nivel gratuito de LocalStack"],"fr":["Déterminer la disponibilité des services dans les différents niveaux de tarification de LocalStack","Identifier la compatibilité ECS sur Kubernetes","Optimiser le développement de KECS avec les limites du niveau gratuit de LocalStack"],"de":["Bestimmen der Serviceverfügbarkeit über die verschiedenen Preistiers von LocalStack","Ermitteln der ECS-Kompatibilität auf Kubernetes","Optimieren der KECS-Entwicklung unter Berücksichtigung der Einschränkungen des kostenlosen Tiers von LocalStack"],"pt":["Determinar a disponibilidade de serviços em diferentes faixas de preços do LocalStack","Identificar a compatibilidade do ECS no Kubernetes","Otimizar o desenvolvimento do KECS com as limitações da faixa de preços gratuita do LocalStack"],"ru":["Определение доступности сервисов на разных тарифных планах LocalStack","Определение совместимости ECS с Kubernetes","Оптимизация разработки KECS с учетом ограничений бесплатного тарифного плана LocalStack"],"ar":["تحديد توافر الخدمات عبر فئات أسعار LocalStack المختلفة","تحديد متطلبات ECS على Kubernetes","تحسين تطوير KECS مع قيود فئة الأسعار المجانية من LocalStack"]},"limitations":{"en":["ECS not available in LocalStack Free tier","Requires Base tier ($39/mo) or higher for ECS","Specific to LocalStack and Kubernetes ecosystems"],"zh":["ECS 不在 LocalStack 免费等级中","需要基础等级（39 美元/月）或更高等级的 ECS","仅限 LocalStack 和 Kubernetes 生态系统"],"ja":["ECS は LocalStack 無料階層では利用できない","ECS にはベース階層（$39/月）以上が必要","LocalStack と Kubernetes のエコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["ECS는 LocalStack 무료 티어에서 사용할 수 없음","ECS에는 기본 티어($39/월) 이상이 필요","LocalStack 및 Kubernetes 생태계에만 해당"],"es":["ECS no disponible en el nivel gratuito de LocalStack","Requiere el nivel Base ($39/mes) o superior para ECS","Específico para los ecosistemas de LocalStack y Kubernetes"],"fr":["ECS non disponible dans le niveau gratuit de LocalStack","Nécessite le niveau Base ($39/mois) ou supérieur pour ECS","Spécifique aux écosystèmes LocalStack et Kubernetes"],"de":["ECS nicht verfügbar im kostenlosen Tier von LocalStack","Benötigt das Basis-Tier ($39/Monat) oder höher für ECS","Spezifisch für die Ökosysteme von LocalStack und Kubernetes"],"pt":["ECS não está disponível na faixa de preços gratuita do LocalStack","Exige a faixa de preços Base ($39/mês) ou superior para o ECS","Específico para os ecossistemas do LocalStack e do Kubernetes"],"ru":["ECS недоступен в бесплатном тарифном плане LocalStack","Требуется тарифный план Base ($39/мес) или выше для ECS","Конкретно для экосистем LocalStack и Kubernetes"],"ar":["ECS غير متوفر في فئة الأسعار المجانية من LocalStack","يتطلب فئة الأسعار الأساسية ($39/الشهر) أو أعلى من أجل ECS","محدد لنظامي LocalStack و Kubernetes البيئيين"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"9d5ce732e7150e9209725e74c3cefb0d0a3c170b052c7ac19146a465329db024","qualityScore":20}');
