INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('joolbits/latitude/latitude-biome-authority', 'latitude-biome-authority', 'joolbits', 'latitude', 'community', 'latitude-biome-authority joolbits latitude community latitude-biome-authority is a Minecraft Fabric mod that generates deterministic latitude-based biome bands. It benefits Minecraft developers and modders seeking precise control over biome generation. Latitude Biome Authority 是一个 Minecraft Fabric 模组，提供确定性纬度基于生物群落带的功能 Latitude Biome Authority は、Minecraft Fabric モッドの決定的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンドを提供するモジュールです Latitude Biome Authority는 결정적 위도 기반 생물 군집 대를 제공하는 Minecraft Fabric 모듈입니다 Latitude-biome-authority es un mod de Minecraft Fabric que permite la creación de biomas determinísticos en función de la latitud. Proporciona reglas para la generación de biomas Latitude-biome-authority est un mod Minecraft Fabric qui permet la création de biomes déterministes en fonction de la latitude. Fournit des règles pour la génération de biomes Latitude-biome-authority ist ein Minecraft Fabric-Mod, der die Erstellung deterministischer Biome in Abhängigkeit von der Breite ermöglicht. Bietet Regeln für die Biome-Generierung O latitude-biome-authority é um mod do Minecraft Fabric que cria biomas determinísticos baseados em latitude. Saiba mais sobre como configurá-lo. ИИ Агент latitude-biome-authority - мод для Minecraft Fabric, создающий детерминированные биомы на основе широты. Узнайте, как его настроить. الإیجنت latitude-biome-authority هو مود لمينكرافت فابريك يخلق مناطق بيئية محددة بالخطوط العرض. تعلم المزيد حول كيفية إعداده. how to use latitude-biome-authority latitude-biome-authority setup guide minecraft fabric mod biome generation deterministic biome bands latitude-biome-authority vs biome mods install latitude-biome-authority what is latitude-biome-authority minecraft globe-style world creation biome generation for minecraft fabric Latitude Biome Authority Minecraft Fabric 模组 确定性纬度基于生物群落带 Vanilla Minecraft 生物群落 Java 1.21.11 AIエージェント Minecraft 模组开发 Enforces vanilla biome existence in at least one valid generation path Prevents Windsurf from inventing, removing, or reassigning biomes outside the defined table Utilizes latitude bands as authoritative references for biome generation Allows for rarity adjustment as a design parameter Ensures tag omission or logic errors are identifiable as causes for missing biomes latitude-biome-authority is a Minecraft Fabric mod that enables deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds, ensuring consistent and predictable biome generation.');
